# What the faucet job installs (worker.yml, job `faucet`): what a job that holds a key installs (sign.in), and the memory
# engine, in which the faucet keeps its journal (knos.faucet, knos.proof.history). Each by its hash, and nothing else.
#
# Compile again after any change here, and at every release:
#   uv pip compile requirements/faucet.in --generate-hashes --python-version 3.12 --no-config -o requirements/faucet.txt
-r sign.in
